WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:02.899
Speaker 1: . I want to do a little bit of
an update on a story.

00:00:02.899 --> 00:00:07.990
There is a news story here, but there also
isn't in the sense that we already had the

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:15.120
facts about the real covid mortality and fatality
rate in the state of New York.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:20.880
There are a bunch of different headlines now
which say things like New York governor acknowledges

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:28.370
nearly 12000 more covid fatality fatalities
then publicized by Andrew Cuomo.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.000
And the story goes.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.820
New York Governor Kathy Hochul promised more
government transparency on her first day in

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:36.840
office.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:42.650
And by day's end, her administration had quietly
delivered it by acknowledging nearly 12000

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:48.230
more deaths in the state from covid-19 than
had been publicized by her predecessor, Andrew

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:49.230
Cuomo.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:54.880
New York now reports nearly fifty five, four
hundred based on death certificate.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:01:01.640
See, up from 43, 7400 that Cuomo had reported
to the public as of Monday, his last name

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:06.570
in office, we are now releasing more data
than had been released before publicly.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:10.490
So people know the nursing home deaths and
hospital deaths are consistent with what's

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:12.210
being displayed by the CDC.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.049
Got a bunch of emails from people saying,
David, I don't understand.

00:01:15.049 --> 00:01:18.250
I looked on World Committers and the CDC website.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.650
Nothing changed.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:20.740
And that's exactly right.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:29.580
The scandal here was that the Cuomo administration
was not acknowledging roughly these 10 to

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:33.740
12, what was 10 now is known to be 12000 covid
deaths.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.990
But the CDC was always acknowledging them.

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:40.140
And websites like World Committers and others
are based on CDC data.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:45.140
So this is more of a political story than
it is a WOA.

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:47.190
There's actually 12000 more people that died.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:52.229
We knew about that and we reported it feels
like it's been a couple of months since we

00:01:52.229 --> 00:01:53.700
learned of that.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:58.850
Now, when it comes to Andrew Cuomo, what is
even worse, the covid stuff or the sexual

00:01:58.850 --> 00:01:59.850
harassment stuff?

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:04.120
I think at the macro level, not to diminish
what Andrew Cuomo has been credibly accused

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.530
of based on a report.

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:09.720
I think that the covid stuff, without a doubt
has been worse.

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:11.750
But this is not actually new information.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:16.000
It's just that it's now being acknowledged
formally by the state.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.280
Good to see the new governor acknowledge it.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:24.980
At the same time, there's an aspect of this
that seems very political in the sense that

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.620
the data was already out there.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.400
We covered it months ago.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:33.730
This sort of is like a get out of jail free
card for everybody else in the executive branch.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:37.700
And it's probably legitimate to say, really,
this is Andrew Cuomo.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.849
They threw Cuomo out, Cuomo gets the blame.

00:02:40.849 --> 00:02:42.650
And now Kathy Hochul or is it Hochul?

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:45.820
I actually don't know how to pronounce acknowledges
it.

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:47.560
And it's sort of like, hey, everything's good
now.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:54.180
While the truth is, it's very hard to imagine
that more people within the administration

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:57.470
of the state government of New York didn't
know that this was going on.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:02.379
So there's an aspect of this that feels like
this is the perfect timing to just acknowledge

00:03:02.379 --> 00:03:08.519
it and move on and try to avoid any other
consequences for anybody now that Cuomo is

00:03:08.519 --> 00:03:11.709
gone and the numbers match the CDC.

00:03:11.709 --> 00:03:15.910
But in some sense, it's good that they have
now said, yes, this is the real number of

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.940
deaths here in the state of New York.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:22.190
Do you think that this has any importance
beyond just quietly putting it out there so

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:27.519
that now they can move on and try to prevent
anybody else from having any kind of consequence

00:03:27.519 --> 00:03:28.519
as a result?

00:03:28.519 --> 00:03:29.519
Let me know.

00:03:29.519 --> 00:03:35.560
But the data is not new and it seems to me
like a pretty brazen act of say it, sweep

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:40.580
it under the rug, and then if it ever comes
up again, say that was on Cuomo and Cuomo

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:41.580
is now gone.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.150
We've taken care of the problem.

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.630
Everybody's gotten the consequence they deserve.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:46.630
Let me know.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:50.670
We'll be covering this more on our Instagram
where you can find us at The David Pakman

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:51.670
Show.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:54.020
Find me on Instagram as well, David at David
Pakman.

